{
  "an4.93:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.93 ",
  "an4.93:0.2": "10. Asuravagga ",
  "an4.93:0.3": "Dutiyasamādhisutta ",
  "an4.93:1.1": "“Cattārome, bhikkhave, puggalā santo saṁvijjamānā lokasmiṁ. ",
  "an4.93:1.2": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "an4.93:1.3": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo lābhī hoti ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa, na lābhī adhipaññādhammavipassanāya. ",
  "an4.93:1.4": "Idha pana, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo lābhī hoti adhipaññādhammavipassanāya, na lābhī ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa. ",
  "an4.93:1.5": "Idha pana, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo na ceva lābhī hoti ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa na ca lābhī adhipaññādhammavipassanāya. ",
  "an4.93:1.6": "Idha pana, bhikkhave, ekacco puggalo lābhī ceva hoti ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa lābhī ca adhipaññādhammavipassanāya. ",
  "an4.93:2.1": "Tatra, bhikkhave, yvāyaṁ puggalo lābhī hoti ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa na lābhī adhipaññādhammavipassanāya, tena, bhikkhave, puggalena ajjhattaṁ cetosamathe patiṭṭhāya adhipaññādhammavipassanāya yogo karaṇīyo. ",
  "an4.93:2.2": "So aparena samayena lābhī ceva hoti ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa lābhī ca adhipaññādhammavipassanāya. ",
  "an4.93:3.1": "Tatra, bhikkhave, yvāyaṁ puggalo lābhī adhipaññādhammavipassanāya na lābhī ajjhattaṁ cetosamathassa, tena, bhikkhave, puggalena adhipaññādhammavipassanāya patiṭṭhāya ajjhattaṁ cetosamathe yogo karaṇīyo. ",
  "an4.93:3.2": "So aparena samayena lābhī ceva hoti adhipaññādhammavipassan